{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7b2484875324cfcd5e9fc2daeeac4635ef01c32f2eed9cde7dd35e2f70e24a76",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a:2_3_006_11_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bd33e360e3787c7305f6b616ba8784dc1e097a5da0b2e7a8841ecc20f5bc20c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n青空吃饱饱美食节非常热闹呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a:2_3_006_11_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4a89cffb72a841933e5d87ccd5e15696a54e4e24ac63115eea1f6470201a22c",
      "text": "当地的特色美食，每一种都超级好吃啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a:2_3_006_11_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2cf2c8a50e63574c58faaf7444b2d099722ded78a36d0eead9196b56813f900",
      "text": "翼先生大快朵颐的样子，\n看着真痛快",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a:2_3_006_11_09_a:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b5d8799de9270c12b33ebf7fdfe0a61ef9f63332192dccb0dfd15042005298d",
      "text": "恭喜您在碗子荞麦面\n大赛中获胜",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a:2_3_006_11_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c22e73fe78e099ca0992114bd1f0499948a082d219fcbc74238f6e623b0cdd7",
      "text": "啊哈哈，是指碗子荞麦面大赛的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a:2_3_006_11_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e994f8ab0b7e31174ef68f591301b1df9d488c84e51f02d7537b778c7652054e",
      "text": "那个啊，听到全场的加油声太开心太起劲了，\n不知不觉筷子就停不下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a:2_3_006_11_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feaed9877bede1795bb130bf9c22e97db7ec0792fc07c5c9460de29de15708b3",
      "text": "谢谢。看到大家的笑容太开心了，\n不知不觉食欲就涌上来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a:2_3_006_11_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39ae40cb26544479cdd4ce9ef2a7eedb9087584d6e7bb87273582303418a5305",
      "text": "能拿到获胜奖品的蛋糕，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a:2_3_006_11_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0f2c2e9cff7a6cde2b6144c1d2f0f5584a9dd05ee5b9e39e1a10b983d7bd75a",
      "text": "好吃的东西，大家一起吃的话\n心情会变得更加幸福呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a:2_3_006_11_09_a:cmd-000028:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be3cdd64addad0f3805f98c1588c19a5b8c5211d450c7040c7702b79ba2ebfef",
      "text": "能成为一份出色的工作\n真是太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a:2_3_006_11_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c90b75396a71a1f2f6a6903dd41a8a762a3b314634277e09136a5eb7a2fcdf7",
      "text": "制作人也是，\n谢谢你为我接下这么棒的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_311_2_3_006_11_09_a:2_3_006_11_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b31a02a8e4cab522b795143236c93cebc7cb303efc17d37182331e021421f892",
      "text": "下一份工作我也会加油的。\n那就晚安啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
